{"id":"4e1e503ea918b41a","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-CT.md","title":"全真理语言归纳的组合真理理论","display":"df-CT — 全真理语言归纳的组合真理理论","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-CT","aliases":["91-df-CT","91-df-compositional-truth-CT","91-df-CT-theory"],"display":"df-CT — 全真理语言归纳的组合真理理论","depends_on":["[[91-df-compositional-truth]]","[[91-df-induction-schema]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-CT"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-CT</span><span>91-df-compositional-truth-CT</span><span>91-df-CT-theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-CT — 全真理语言归纳的组合真理理论"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"66b3ab8406681395\" href=\"?note=66b3ab8406681395\" title=\"91-df-compositional-truth\">91-df-compositional-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"09791de618b277ba\" href=\"?note=09791de618b277ba\" title=\"91-df-induction-schema\">91-df-induction-schema</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\)</span> 为基础语言六条编码组合公理加 PA；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Ind}_T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"09791de618b277ba\" href=\"?note=09791de618b277ba\" title=\"91-df-induction-schema\">91-df-induction-schema</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}\\)</span> 是本节点定义的理论。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}CT}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{CT}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}CT}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{CT}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应原书 Definition 8.28；本目录 CT<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"^-\">\\(^-\\)</span> 对应原书 CT<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\upharpoonright\">\\(\\upharpoonright\\)</span>。原书 Theorem 8.32 证明 CT 的 PA 全局反射；排除 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0=1\">\\(0=1\\)</span> 为真后得到 PA 一致性。因此在 PA 一致时 CT 非保守。\nTB 和 UTB 即使含完整真理语言归纳也对 PA 保守（Theorem 7.5）。逐句恢复 T-双条件已在 CT<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"^-\">\\(^-\\)</span> 中完成，不是 CT 非保守性的理由。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 8.28、Theorem 8.32、Corollary 8.33，印刷页 89–93，PDF 页 100–104。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-compositional-truth","status":"resolved","id":"66b3ab8406681395","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-compositional-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-induction-schema","status":"resolved","id":"09791de618b277ba","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-induction-schema]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-induction-schema","status":"resolved","id":"09791de618b277ba","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CT}^{-}$ 为基础语言六条编码组合公理加 PA；$\\mathrm{Ind}_T$、$\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}$ 见 [[91-df-induction-schema]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ind}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}CT}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{CT}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\cup\\mathrm{Ind}_T).","display":true},{"tex":"^-","display":false},{"tex":"\\upharpoonright","display":false},{"tex":"0=1","display":false},{"tex":"^-","display":false}],"bytes":1250,"backlinks":[{"id":"66b3ab8406681395","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本目录沿用常见 $\\mathrm{CT}^{-}$ 记号，对应原书 $\\mathrm{ct}\\upharpoonright$。完整 $\\mathrm{CT}$ 在 [[91-df-CT]] 加入 $\\mathcal L_T$ 归纳。\nTheorem 8.5 证明 $\\mathrm{CT}^{-}$ 对 PA 保守；这不意味着每个 PA 模型都能直接添加满足类。2014 修订版已撤回初版中的错误消切证明，不能把那段证明作为已验证依据。"},{"id":"8f32f747a261016d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"73ccb673e6681e3d","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CT}$ 为 [[91-df-CT]] 的完整真理语言归纳版本。"},{"id":"a295446296ee06c0","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-42","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-coded-syntax.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\n[[91-df